676
00:23:52,568 --> 00:23:53,698
Seung Ho, do you want to try?

677
00:23:53,698 --> 00:23:54,998
(Seung Ho also practices.)

678
00:23:55,468 --> 00:23:56,968
- Is this how you flick it?
- Flick it like this.

679
00:23:56,968 --> 00:23:58,138
- Like this.
- Like this?

680
00:23:58,208 --> 00:23:59,608
Like this, horizontally.

681
00:23:59,768 --> 00:24:01,138
But if you do that, the bottle cap flies to the side.

682
00:24:01,138 --> 00:24:02,608
Exactly. Hey, Seung Ho.

683
00:24:03,108 --> 00:24:04,808
If you flick like that, the bottle cap flies to the side.

684
00:24:04,808 --> 00:24:06,248
- Is this how you flick it?
- Like this.

685
00:24:06,248 --> 00:24:07,378
- May I try?
- Go ahead.

686
00:24:08,678 --> 00:24:10,588
(Getting into position as he was taught)

687
00:24:14,258 --> 00:24:16,288
(Seung Ho stares at Jae Seok.)

688
00:24:16,288 --> 00:24:17,358
Why are you looking at me?

689
00:24:17,528 --> 00:24:19,088
We'd better practice multiple times.

690
00:24:19,088 --> 00:24:20,298
- Use them.
- Practice.

691
00:24:20,298 --> 00:24:21,328
Seung Ho, why'd you look at me?

692
00:24:21,328 --> 00:24:22,598
You rarely play Alkkagi, right?

693
00:24:22,598 --> 00:24:24,098
(Cutting him off cleanly)

694
00:24:24,228 --> 00:24:25,298
Go low.

695
00:24:25,968 --> 00:24:26,998
Go low?

696
00:24:27,598 --> 00:24:28,598
That's...

697
00:24:29,398 --> 00:24:31,638
Even if it hits the bottom of the lid, the lid doesn't close.

698
00:24:31,638 --> 00:24:33,238
It should fly a little. This is too far away.

699
00:24:33,238 --> 00:24:34,308
Yes, it should fly a little.

700
00:24:35,308 --> 00:24:36,338
(The bottle cap keeps flying away.)

701
00:24:36,338 --> 00:24:38,048
Seung Ho, you're not getting any hits.

702
00:24:38,548 --> 00:24:39,848
Is it because of the thimble?

703
00:24:40,678 --> 00:24:41,678
(Breathing in)

704
00:24:41,678 --> 00:24:42,918
- Shall we give it a try?
- Shall we?

705
00:24:43,078 --> 00:24:44,418
- Shall we?
- Let's do it.

706
00:24:44,418 --> 00:24:45,618
- Okay.
- Good.

707
00:24:45,748 --> 00:24:46,958
- Flick three each.
- Yes.

708
00:24:46,958 --> 00:24:48,158
- We'll do 2.
- Yes, 2.

709
00:24:48,158 --> 00:24:49,358
- Three each, and two each for us.
- Yes.

710
00:24:49,358 --> 00:24:51,558
Then what about the order? First...

711
00:24:52,358 --> 00:24:54,298
Regard me as a useless card.

712
00:24:54,298 --> 00:24:55,328
No.

713
00:24:55,328 --> 00:24:56,898
- The aim doesn't zero in right now.
- What are you talking about?

714
00:24:57,268 --> 00:24:58,468
- The zero...
- Just try it for now.

715
00:24:58,498 --> 00:25:00,098
Okay, then should I go first?

716
00:25:00,098 --> 00:25:02,568
- Go ahead.
- Seung Ho will go first.

717
00:25:02,768 --> 00:25:03,838
- Go last, Young K.
- I...

718
00:25:03,838 --> 00:25:04,868
- Okay.
- Young K, go last.

719
00:25:04,868 --> 00:25:06,368
- I'll go 2nd.
- Then I'll go 3rd.

720
00:25:06,368 --> 00:25:07,408
- Good.
- First.

721
00:25:07,608 --> 00:25:08,838
- Good luck.
- Second.

722
00:25:09,208 --> 00:25:10,548
Let's do a group cheer.

723
00:25:10,678 --> 00:25:12,648
Let's go! Come, Mi Ri.

724
00:25:12,648 --> 00:25:14,748
- In 1, 2, 3. Go!
- In 1, 2, 3. Go!

725
00:25:14,748 --> 00:25:16,478
- Nice.
- Then...

726
00:25:17,448 --> 00:25:18,848
Let me line them up first.

727
00:25:19,648 --> 00:25:21,188
- Let's do this!
- Good luck!

728
00:25:21,318 --> 00:25:22,458
- Even just one.
- We need to secure the prize.

729
00:25:22,458 --> 00:25:23,488
For sure.

730
00:25:23,928 --> 00:25:25,158
Covert running.

731
00:25:25,158 --> 00:25:26,728
- Call it.
- All right.

732
00:25:27,028 --> 00:25:28,528
- Here I go, okay?
- Okay.

733
00:25:29,258 --> 00:25:30,868
- Here we go.
- Ready.

734
00:25:30,868 --> 00:25:33,538
(Out of 10 total tries, they're on try number 1.)

735
00:25:34,138 --> 00:25:35,168
Set.

736
00:25:40,108 --> 00:25:41,608
- Nice!
- What?

737
00:25:41,778 --> 00:25:43,978
- Nice!
- Nice!

738
00:25:43,978 --> 00:25:44,978
For real?

739
00:25:45,448 --> 00:25:47,318
(Close 1 more lid, and they'll succeed Round 1.)

740
00:25:47,718 --> 00:25:48,918
