- Then you go...

1426
00:49:15,831 --> 00:49:18,061
- Go that way.
- Make another turn.

1427
00:49:18,061 --> 00:49:19,731
- It goes down and sideways.
- Yes.

1428
00:49:19,831 --> 00:49:20,871
