1429
00:49:20,871 --> 00:49:22,501
(Seung Ho is exempt from paying.)

1430
00:49:22,501 --> 00:49:24,101
It wasn't him. It's either you or me, Jae Seok.

1431
00:49:26,011 --> 00:49:27,711
- We're saved.
- I'll pick number four.

1432
00:49:27,711 --> 00:49:28,711
- Number four?
- Yes.

1433
00:49:28,711 --> 00:49:30,041
- Thank you for the meal, guys.
- Number four.

1434
00:49:30,041 --> 00:49:31,611
- Let's try number four.
- Really?

1435
00:49:31,611 --> 00:49:33,451
(Jae Seok is next.)

1436
00:49:33,451 --> 00:49:34,851
- The music is changing.
- It goes this way, right?

1437
00:49:35,081 --> 00:49:36,221
It's getting gloomier.

1438
00:49:36,621 --> 00:49:38,281
Hey. Let's survive.

1439
00:49:38,581 --> 00:49:39,591
Survive no matter what.

1440
00:49:39,591 --> 00:49:40,891
- Here it goes.
- Am I doing it right?

1441
00:49:41,021 --> 00:49:42,091
Am I?

1442
00:49:42,391 --> 00:49:43,921
- Here it goes.
- That's it.

1443
00:49:44,361 --> 00:49:46,091
- What?
- It's here.

1444
00:49:46,261 --> 00:49:47,991
- You're approaching it.
- It's you.

1445
00:49:47,991 --> 00:49:49,061
It's you.

1446
00:49:49,061 --> 00:49:51,631
(Yes. He's going for it.)

1447
00:49:52,301 --> 00:49:53,901
- What?
- It's here.

1448
00:49:53,901 --> 00:49:55,601
- Wait.
- It's you.

1449
00:49:55,601 --> 00:49:57,141
It's you!

1450
00:49:57,141 --> 00:50:00,171
(Jae Seok has to pay for this meal.)

1451
00:50:00,311 --> 00:50:01,971
- Thanks, Jae Seok.
- Thank you, Jae Seok.

1452
00:50:01,971 --> 00:50:03,841
Sure. Goodness.

1453
00:50:04,441 --> 00:50:06,781
- See?
- We only had Korean set meals.

1454
00:50:06,881 --> 00:50:09,021
- We should've gone to Wolfgang's.
- Wolfgang's Steakhouse.

1455
00:50:09,121 --> 00:50:11,651
We should've gone to Wolfgang's on a day like this.

1456
00:50:11,651 --> 00:50:13,051
We should've waited 30 minutes.

1457
00:50:13,051 --> 00:50:15,221
Gosh. I would've been in trouble if we had gone to the steakhouse.

1458
00:50:15,221 --> 00:50:16,421
Gosh. We should've gone there.

1459
00:50:16,861 --> 00:50:18,521
Now, I'll pay for lunch...

1460
00:50:18,721 --> 00:50:20,291
here at Cheongdam Valley.

1461
00:50:20,291 --> 00:50:21,461
- Thank you.
- Thank you.

1462
00:50:21,461 --> 00:50:22,631
Let's go.

1463
00:50:22,631 --> 00:50:23,761
Thank you.

1464
00:50:24,661 --> 00:50:26,131
Gosh. It's nothing.

1465
00:50:26,901 --> 00:50:29,401
No need to thank me. This is nothing.

1466
00:50:30,341 --> 00:50:31,401
Thank you.

1467
00:50:31,571 --> 00:50:33,541
- Gosh. Thanks for lunch.
- Thank you.

1468
00:50:33,541 --> 00:50:35,311
It was a really good lunch.

1469
00:50:35,571 --> 00:50:36,681
- Shall we?
- Yes.

1470
00:50:36,981 --> 00:50:39,081
- It's peak lunch hour.
- Yes.

1471
00:50:39,251 --> 00:50:41,611
I see a cafe on the way.

1472
00:50:41,611 --> 00:50:42,821
- Really?
- It's on the first floor.

1473
00:50:43,121 --> 00:50:45,421
What? They have sorbet and bingsu.

1474
00:50:45,681 --> 00:50:47,451
- Where?
- Here.

1475
00:50:48,791 --> 00:50:50,791
- Low-calorie desserts.
- They have everything.

1476
00:50:50,791 --> 00:50:52,091
- They have an Americano.
- I love it.

1477
00:50:52,091 --> 00:50:53,391
Let's go in.

1478
00:50:53,691 --> 00:50:54,731
Do we make a bet again?

1479
00:50:54,731 --> 00:50:56,901
Yes. Let's ask the employee to pick a card this time...

1480
00:50:57,301 --> 00:50:58,631
