- Hello.

1481
00:50:59,401 --> 00:51:01,771
- Hello.
- They have a great selection.

1482
00:51:02,101 --> 00:51:03,171
They have bingsu too.

1483
00:51:04,441 --> 00:51:06,571
I'm going to get the classic bingsu.

1484
00:51:07,011 --> 00:51:08,911
- I'll get an iced Americano.
- Okay.

1485
00:51:09,481 --> 00:51:11,481
And one black raspberry tea, please.

1486
00:51:11,481 --> 00:51:13,211
And two iced Americanos.

1487
00:51:13,351 --> 00:51:15,311
Then I'll get the classic bingsu.

1488
00:51:15,311 --> 00:51:17,451
- There you go.
- We'll get two bingsus.

1489
00:51:17,981 --> 00:51:20,951
Please pick a card out of four cards to pay.

