- It's the fancy card.

1494
00:51:31,101 --> 00:51:32,431
This is a fancy one too.

1495
00:51:32,431 --> 00:51:34,671
- Look.
- It's a purple one.

1496
00:51:35,001 --> 00:51:36,301
That card stands out.

1497
