It's Seung Ho's card.

1500
00:51:44,741 --> 00:51:46,011
- Gosh. I'm saved.
- It's Seung Ho's.

1501
00:51:46,011 --> 00:51:48,581
Wait. She picked the most ordinary-looking card.

1502
00:51:48,851 --> 00:51:51,151
- They all have fancy cards, ma'am.
- Please run that card.

1503
00:51:51,451 --> 00:51:53,791
- Thank you.
- Others are fancy, but...

1504
00:51:54,091 --> 00:51:56,421
- Gosh. It's hilarious.
- They all have fancy cards.

1505
00:51:56,991 --> 00:51:59,331
- Yours was the same as mine.
- Oh, really?

1506
00:52:00,091 --> 00:52:01,131
Gosh.

1507
00:52:01,131 --> 00:52:03,731
Seung Ho's treating us today.

1508
00:52:04,301 --> 00:52:06,201
- She picked the perfect card.
- Thanks, Seung Ho.

1509
00:52:06,531 --> 00:52:08,831
- This place is...
- Seung Ho. It was hilarious.

1510
00:52:09,871 --> 00:52:11,171
"There are many fancy cards."

1511
00:52:11,171 --> 00:52:12,541
(Doing Seung Ho's impression)

1512
00:52:13,641 --> 00:52:14,711
(Staring)

1513
00:52:14,711 --> 00:52:17,841
I should've ordered some cookies.

1514
00:52:17,841 --> 00:52:19,041
A red bean brownie. They have good red beans.

1515
00:52:19,041 --> 00:52:20,081
It sounds tasty.

1516
00:52:20,181 --> 00:52:22,081
Don't you think we should try a red bean brownie, Seung Ho?

1517
00:52:23,751 --> 00:52:25,721
- And a carrot cake.
- I think we're good.

1518
00:52:26,421 --> 00:52:28,021
